  "title": "Revert \"XML: Delay registering fields\"",
  "description": "Unfortunately, some of the DTDs register additional media types\nand set up handoffs to the XML handle. We can't delay parsing them\nuntil the XML handle is called, because the XML dissector might\nnever be called if the handoff isn't set up.\n\nThis reverts commit d218d6754f538ef25499ff837f70dab756a77052",
